  tile source licensed for your use if you deploy at scale or commercially.

Software
--------
Runtime dependencies (Next.js, React, deck.gl, MapLibre GL, Recharts, framer-motion,
lucide-react, pandas, psycopg, ...) are distributed under their own open source licenses;
see package-lock.json and etl/requirements.txt.

AI chat
-------
The optional chat sends the user's question to a third-party model provider through
OpenRouter. The numbers shown in answers are always computed by this code from the
published data files, never by the model.

Fonts
-----
Fraunces and Figtree are served from this site (web/public/fonts), under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, so that
visitors' browsers do not contact a third party. DM Mono is bundled by Next.js at build time (also OFL 1.1).
See web/public/fonts/LICENZA-FONT.txt.
